iew": 1659, "last_played": 1648861969, "avatar": "bca13f31adb47032c3d2d62becc0b4c7666b59eb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game but it doesnt open or work and of course EA isnt doing anything about it.", "timestamp_created": 1647632761, "timestamp_updated": 1647632761, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.456273764371871948", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112347861", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026565056", "personaname": "Shadoctr", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dr_ubershadow_md/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 789, "playtime_forever": 1250, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1250, "last_played": 1647400602, "avatar": "0d2c28b04833ac9d8b21bd200dea8c84a2e51da8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Mass Effect 3 is the third game in the Mass Effect Trilogy. After three years, the Reapers are finally here and the Milky Way is very unprepared. In my option, the story is very stupidly annoying. They didn't do anything to prepared for the Reapers, and 90% of the galaxy still wants to fight among themselves. The gameplay is the only saving grace for this game. It drastically  improve all the different classes you can be, and the combat is alot smoother. One thing did annoy me with the combat was when I tried to run around, it would snap me to cover which got me killed more times than me being stupid. There wasn't even a final boss fight, more like a survival waves. My option on the trilogy after the Series Series; ME1=Best Story, ME2=Best Characters, and ME3=Best Gameplay. And I give this a 7/10.", "timestamp_created": 1647519471, "timestamp_updated": 1647519845, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112312364", "author": {"steamid": "76561198406110310", "personaname": "KeppelBlue", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198406110310/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 613, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 225, "last_played": 1672205673, "avatar": "6b9db04a8d9fd5670a2ced9a877ddcb58ca3dcc6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fails to launch, when it does launch screen goes black and takes over all functions of computer which results in a force shutdown via power button to regain control of computer", "timestamp_created": 1647468550, "timestamp_updated": 1647468550, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.481927722692489624", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112305184", "author": {"steamid": "76561198420930044", "personaname": "Sachith Perera", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198420930044/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 58, "playtime_forever": 5819, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2995, "last_played": 1654782970, "avatar": "90d7a9da42ddc2e500d9d2c361363fe539c67da8"}, "language": "english", "review": "[b] POSITIVES: [/b]\n[list]\n    [*] The story is full of emotional moments and tough choices \n    [*] Combat is vastly improved; holds up well even after a decade\n    [*] A wide array of weapons, armor, and mods\n    [*] Incredible OST\n    [*] Additional DLCs are worth buying\n [/list]\n[b] NEGATIVES: [/b]\n[list]\n    [*] Requires EA Origi